sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Profile / Dashboard
    participant SC as strava-connect
    participant STV as Strava API
    participant WH as strava-webhook
    participant CRON as strava-cron-sync (every 15m)
    participant DB as Postgres
    U->>FE: Click "Connect Strava"
    FE->>STV: OAuth authorize (redirect)
    STV-->>FE: /auth/strava/callback?code
    FE->>SC: exchange code
    SC->>STV: token exchange
    STV-->>SC: access + refresh tokens
    SC->>DB: upsert strava_tokens
    Note over STV,WH: New Activity uploaded to Strava
    STV-->>WH: POST webhook (activity id)
    WH->>STV: GET activity detail (refresh token if needed)
    WH->>DB: insert activity_logs (idempotent on strava_id)
    DB->>DB: trigger activity_logs_sync_registration_total
    DB->>DB: recompute progress + user_milestones + certificate
    DB-->>FE: Realtime postgres_changes push
    FE->>FE: React Query invalidate + UI updates
    CRON->>STV: safety-net poll for missed webhooks
